<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 11:06:12 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>今日对应精油推荐</title><link>https://some.pics/6afed81fc799e</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;今日对应 — 2026年11月19日&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;蓝色 · 罗勒 · 丁香花蕾精油&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://mizjeannie.com/almanac"&gt;在Miz Jeannie上规划这一天 →&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Today's Correspondences for November 19, 2026. Color: Blue — peace, truth, intuition, dreams. Plant: Basil (Ocimum basilicum) — prosperity, protection, love, success. Oil: Clove Bud essential oil — protection, prosperity. The graphic also explains why each fits today's almanac context." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6afed81fc799e.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 11:06:12 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>久违的跑步</title><link>https://some.pics/6afe9e888087c</link><description>&lt;p&gt;🏃🏻 好久不见了。都一周了？！&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="🏃🏻 It’s been a while. A week?!" height="1486" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/atog/6afe9e888087c.jpg" width="1179"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://atog.some.pics"&gt;@atog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 07:00:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>动物森友会咖啡桌梗</title><link>https://some.pics/6afe678e97123</link><description>&lt;p&gt;哈哈，这个《动物森友会：口袋露营》的活动物品让我想起了《当哈利遇到莎莉》里的那句台词：“总有一天，信不信由你，你们会为了谁得到这张咖啡桌而大战十五个回合。这张愚蠢的、马车轮式的、罗伊·罗杰斯的、车库拍卖的咖啡桌！”

虽然不是马车轮，但看起来就像那张桌子！😆&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt='Screenshot from Animal Crossing: Pocket Camp showing a "nautical wheel table," a ship steering wheel as table base with a glass top' height="2868" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/jezlyn/6afe678e97123.png" width="1320"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://jezlyn.some.pics"&gt;@jezlyn&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:05:53 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>巫术助你开启新生活</title><link>https://some.pics/6afe54e5dbbe8</link><description>&lt;p&gt;巫术能助你开启新的篇章。搬入新家时，你可以在门口致欢迎辞，或为厨房写下祝福。这是一种让你关注变化的方式。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Painted fantasy illustration of a welcoming witch at the open door of an enormous acorn home, with rose curtains, oak leaves, moving boxes, a rolled rug, and a black cat. Ivory serif lettering spans the charcoal background, and a gold botanical emblem sits at bottom-right. Text: Witchcraft can help you mark a new beginning. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6afe54e5dbbe8.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 01:46:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>日月同辉伴飞机</title><link>https://some.pics/6afe516651d99</link><description>&lt;p&gt;日月与飞机&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A crescent moon and an airplane in a blue sky with light clouds." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/macmanx/6afe516651d99.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://macmanx.some.pics"&gt;@macmanx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 01:31:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>秋季越野跑正当时</title><link>https://some.pics/6afe4bfed62dc</link><description>&lt;p&gt;这个时节，沿着小径奔跑真是无与伦比的享受。当然，前提是地上还没积雪。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="An eye-level shot of a path through a forest of trees, with leaf-covered ground." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/ericmwalk/6afe4bfed62dc.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://ericmwalk.some.pics"&gt;@ericmwalk&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 01:09:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>仙女屋：流光焰火之年</title><link>https://some.pics/6afdf2c76badc</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;来自辉煌火焰之年的仙女屋&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="fairy houses from the Year of Fulgent Fla es" height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/doomed/6afdf2c76badc.jpg" width="1545"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://doomed.some.pics"&gt;@doomed&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 18:47:38 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>我的黄金女孩</title><link>https://some.pics/6afdeb76e112a</link><description>&lt;p&gt;我的金发女孩&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="the alysa liu themed bratz 'bratziez' keychain (it looks kinda like a labubu), this version is her olympic practice outfit with the legwarmers it's adorable" height="1600" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/lachesis/6afdeb76e112a.jpg" width="1200"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://lachesis.some.pics"&gt;@lachesis&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 18:16:25 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>唤醒记忆梦境的仪式盐</title><link>https://some.pics/6afddd9be256b</link><description>&lt;p&gt;醒来时回忆梦境的仪式盐
